# Derived by hand from Type System ch. 4 (an element's `$` field is a `$T`, live or described) and ch. 2 (an element applied is a plain value): `$Shown` of the description reads the text it was given, `$Shown e`, which follows the child's label; the placed element follows it in the tick of the click.
test one_pattern_reads_both_forms

tick 0
  added:
    0/[0]/0: Ui.Button(label="inc")
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="<<0>> True")

tick 1
  in:
    0/[0]/0: click
  changed:
    0/[1]/0: Ui.Label(text="<<1>> True")
